          "title": { "show": true, "level": 1 },
          "image": {},
          "src": null,
          "text": {
            "format": 1,
            "content": "<h1>The Valley</h1><p>Ask for @UUID[Actor.npcSmith0000001]{the smith} at the forge, or find @UUID[Actor.npcSmith0000001] yourself. The @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.rules.JournalEntry.abc]{rules} say a lot; @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.rules.JournalEntry.abc] says nothing.</p><ul><li>Bring rope.</li><li>Keep to the road.</li></ul><p><img src=\"worlds/test-world/well.webp\" alt=\"A well with a broken rope\"></p><table><tr><th>Day</th><th>Weather</th></tr><tr><td>One</td><td>Rain</td></tr></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-abc\"><p>GM ONLY: the well hides the vault.</p></section><script>alert('x')</script><style>p{color:red}</style><p>Make a [[/check ability=wis skill=prc dc=12]] to spot the path, or suffer [[/damage 2d6 fire]].</p>"
          }
